      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f951f504852561cbff1ab84|full_name}: VRChat does verify if you have atleast 1 friend in that friend+ instance, but it doesn't mean you can't join it without invite. As long as they're in the instance and you find the world's name (usually you don't even need instanceId, because if you click on the world, and look into instance list the friends/friends+ instance will appear there) and boom you can join in without invite.\n\nOfc, another question is if this is something that should be worried about, because if you have friends that are going to do this constantly, maybe you should consider if they still should be your friends.",
